{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_1_level_main_01-08_beg","groupId":"main_1","stageId":"main_01-08","title":"意志","storyCode":"1-8","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"9f81c734a84ef7c6380c328ad741e9ca5f8d7dc8dc3fe5fdff301e03d16fbea7","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"面对塔露拉的强横，阿米娅选择了■ ■ ■ ■。\n但阿米娅终究还是无法阻止塔露拉。就在她要坚持不住时，Ace站在了她的身前——","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十一关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_7"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，带博士离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......立刻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不行！我不能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"你也感觉到了！她......再这样下去，整个救援队都会葬送在这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"那个塔露拉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"她是活生生的怪物！阿米娅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们一起战斗的话，不会有问题的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"那博士呢？你能保证博士的安全吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"E4小队，我们留在这里断后！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"一定要让阿米娅和Dr.{@nickname}，以及各个医疗小组安全撤离！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"不，交给我和我的小队吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Ace！现在难道是说这种话的时候吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"我很冷静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"你难道没看到吗，她周围的东西，都在融化！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会留下你们独自战斗的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛......绝不会丢下你们的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，时间宝贵！你必须撤退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"——你应该信任我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能看着罗德岛的任何一个人牺牲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"想想任务目标，想想我们的目的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不是说这个的时候！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"——？热量......在......她手里......聚集？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"她周身的景象......扭曲了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"不，那是她......加热了周围的空气！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"小心，她将要使用的法术......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不对......不对！临光！！快回来！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是......那个法术会把你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_7"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"——安静。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呃......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"临光！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......退后！我不要紧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过是......有点烫而已......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"说什么......不要紧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"全身的铠甲没有一块是完好的，究竟哪里不要紧了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能再与她战斗了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"我说了——退后！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"临光！你这倔脾气......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"——哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"蹲下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳......又是什么把戏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"......不可见的火扫过了我们的头顶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"后撤。整个街区都在融化......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"别做无谓的牺牲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"我是在和什么东西战斗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"必须干扰她施术的过程......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"狙击干员！瞄准目标敌人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"反抗会为大地带去希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"但反抗，改变不了你们的命运。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"射击！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"切尔诺伯格已得解放。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的工作已经完成，而我对你们产生了些许兴趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"什么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，也就仅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你们做出了错误的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛，你们该真正站在感染者这边。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_8"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么......回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么整个广场......都被烧焦了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚......发生了......什么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼吸......好烫......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"石块，弩箭，弓矢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"都没了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"一瞬间......她周围的所有事物，全都都被燃烧殆尽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你们具备解放者该有的韧性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"......连渣滓都没剩下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅。你很清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"必须有人，挡住她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"——但我厌烦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_11_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你们总要为杀害同胞而付出代价。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我将赐予你们一个我十分喜爱的结局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"——毁灭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"走，走......快走！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"那种热量和规模......不行，不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"保护阿米娅和博士！快！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"来不及了——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"让我挡住她！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊！！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"阿......阿米娅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不会让你伤害他们的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_1_reflect"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会......允许你这么做的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"————哦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"咕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"必须......让大家......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅她一个人......挡下了敌人的法术......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"不行......那力量太庞大了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是阿米娅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是阿米娅也撑不了多久的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题......我没问题......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我没问题的——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我要......我必须......保护你们！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"黑色......将敌人的法术封在了广场上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......唔啊......呃......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......她，她设下的屏障，在燃烧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，不可以！！那样的话，你的戒指——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕......虽然......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，对不起——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕会带来灾难，哪怕我会......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不能......再看着重要的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"呵————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......啊啊......！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶......再这样下去，阿米娅会......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"你要干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"去毁掉那个龙女的法术！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"——“卡西米尔的光芒啊，耀骑士将为你奉献自身——”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！快走！我们会帮助阿米娅的，你必须......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"————！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊啊啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"唔————？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可以了，阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经很了不起了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"把你的重担，也分给我们一些吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我———"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"杜宾，带他们先走，我一会儿就跟上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......Ace......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Ace......不......Ace......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"一定......要............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，Dr.{@nickname}，你可能不记得我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"但我记得你，也知道你是怎样的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"......总有一天，你要和阿米娅一起共同面对这片残酷的大地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，保护好她，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"祝你们前路无阻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Ace","阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_011_talula","aliases":["塔露拉"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["近卫干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["医疗干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜宾"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["临光"]}]}
